(Quy dinh ve dang ban san pham tren Shopee) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Source: https://help.shopee.vn/portal/4/article/77246) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(QUY INH VE ANG BAN SAN PHAM TREN SHOPEE | Shopee Trung tam tro giup) Tj
T*
(Xin chao, Shopee co the giup gi cho ban?) Tj
T*
(QUY INH VE ANG BAN SAN PHAM TREN SHOPEE) Tj
T*
(A. PHAM VI VA OI TUONG AP DUNG) Tj
T*
(1. oi tuong ap dung) Tj
T*
(Quy inh nay ap dung oi voi tat ca Nguoi Ban tren San TMT Shopee \( San Shopee \)) Tj
T*
(2. Pham vi ap dung) Tj
T*
(Quy inh nay quy inh ve viec ang ban cac san pham tren San Shopee.) Tj
T*
(B. QUY INH CHUNG:) Tj
T*
(1. Nguyen tac chung) Tj
T*
(a. ang ban san pham tren Shopee la hoat ong cua Nguoi Ban dung hang hoa, dich vu va tai) Tj
T*
(lieu ve hang hoa, dich vu e gioi thieu voi khach hang ve hang hoa, dich vu o.) Tj
T*
(b. Khi ang ban san pham tren Shopee, Nguoi Ban co trach nhiem tuan thu cac quy inh tai) Tj
T*
(ieu 117, ieu 120.4, ieu 121 cua Luat Thuong Mai va cac van ban quy pham phap luat co) Tj
T*
(lien quan en hoat ong trung bay, gioi thieu hang hoa, dich vu. oi voi Nguoi Ban la phap) Tj
T*
(nhan co von au tu nuoc ngoai, Nguoi Ban can co Giay phep kinh doanh phu hop voi quy inh) Tj
T*
(cua phap luat hien hanh.) Tj
T*
(c. Tat ca chung tu ma Nguoi Ban uoc yeu cau cung cap thi Nguoi Ban phai am bao va cam) Tj
T*
(ket tat ca cac chung tu ma Nguoi Ban cung cap cho Shopee eu uoc scan tu chung tu goc,) Tj
T*
(khong uoc lam gia, chinh sua, tay xoa.) Tj
T*
(2. Cac noi dung khong uoc phep ang ban) Tj
T*
(Nguoi Ban uoc quyen ang cac san pham len Shopee nham muc ich kinh doanh. Tuy nhien,) Tj
T*
(NGHIEM CAM ang tai nhung san pham co noi dung sau ay:) Tj
T*
(a. Phan ong, chong pha, bai xich ton giao, khieu dam, bao luc, i nguoc lai thuan phong) Tj
T*
(my tuc, truyen thong va van hoa Viet Nam, xam pham chu quyen, toan ven lanh tho, an ninh) Tj
T*
(quoc gia cua Viet Nam;) Tj
T*
(b. ang thong tin rac, pha roi hay lam mat uy tin cua cac dich vu do Shopee cung cap;) Tj
T*
(c. Xuc pham, khich bac en nguoi khac duoi bat ky hinh thuc nao;) Tj
T*
(d. Tuyen truyen ve nhung thong tin ma phap luat nghiem cam nhu: su dung heroin, thuoc) Tj
T*
(lac, giet nguoi, cuop cua,vv... \(Vi du: san pham in hinh la can sa, shisha\);) Tj
T*
(e. Khuyen khich, quang cao cho viec su dung cac san pham oc hai \(VD: thuoc la, ruou, can) Tj
T*
(sa\);) Tj
T*
(f. Cac san pham van hoa oi truy \(bang ia, sach bao, vat pham\);) Tj
T*
(g. Tai lieu bi mat quoc gia, bi mat nha nuoc, bi mat kinh doanh, bi mat ca nhan;) Tj
T*
(h. Con nguoi va/hoac cac bo phan cua co the con nguoi;) Tj
T*
(i. ong vat va che pham tu ong vat \(bao gom ong vat hoang da\) nhu: cho, meo, ca, oc,) Tj
T*
(chuot, nhim, oc muon hon, hamster, nga voi, sung te giac, cao ho, da/ long ong vat,...\)) Tj
T*
(j. Nhung san pham co tinh chat phan biet chung toc, xuc pham en dan toc hoac quoc gia) Tj
T*
(nao o;) Tj
T*
(k. Han che toi a nhung san pham mang tinh ca nhan \(nhu hinh ca nhan, hinh anh cua gia) Tj
T*
(inh, hinh anh cua con cai\);) Tj
T*
(l. Vi pham quyen so huu tri tue va/hoac bat ky nhan hieu hang hoa nao cua bat ky ben thu) Tj
T*
(ba nao;) Tj
T*
(m. Cac san pham nam trong Danh sach san pham bi cam/han che cua Shopee.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
