(3. Cac hanh vi khong uoc thuc hien) Tj
T*
(a. Su dung thong tin, hinh anh, am thanh vi pham phap luat, thieu tham my, trai voi) Tj
T*
(truyen thong lich su, van hoa, ao uc, thuan phong my tuc Viet Nam.) Tj
T*
(b. Xuc pham uy tin, danh du, nhan pham cua to chuc, ca nhan.) Tj
T*
(c. Su dung hinh anh, loi noi, chu viet cua ca nhan khi chua uoc ca nhan o ong y, tru) Tj
T*
(truong hop uoc phap luat cho phep.) Tj
T*
(d. Cung cap thong tin, quang cao khong ung hoac gay nham lan ve kha nang kinh doanh, kha) Tj
T*
(nang cung cap san pham, hang hoa, dich vu cua to chuc, ca nhan kinh doanh san pham, hang) Tj
T*
(hoa, dich vu; ve so luong, chat luong, gia, cong dung, kieu dang, bao bi, nhan hieu,) Tj
T*
(xuat xu, chung loai, phuong thuc phuc vu, thoi han bao hanh cua san pham, hang hoa, dich) Tj
T*
(vu a ang ky hoac a uoc cong bo.) Tj
T*
(e. So sanh truc tiep ve gia ca, chat luong, hieu qua su dung san pham, hang hoa, dich vu) Tj
T*
(cua minh voi gia ca, chat luong, hieu qua su dung san pham, hang hoa, dich vu cung loai) Tj
T*
(cua to chuc, ca nhan khac.) Tj
T*
(f. Co noi dung canh tranh khong lanh manh theo quy inh cua phap luat ve canh tranh.) Tj
T*
(g. Quang cao cho cac doanh nghiep khac. Vi du nhu san pham co chua hinh anh, logo, ia) Tj
T*
(chi, hotline, uong link cua doanh nghiep hoac website mua ban khac.) Tj
T*
(h. ang ban mot san pham lap i lap lai \(spam\) tren cung mot danh muc hoac cac danh muc) Tj
T*
(khac nhau.) Tj
T*
(i. Thay oi noi dung tin ang e gian lan anh gia hoac tao on ao e gian lan tang so luong) Tj
T*
(on hang va anh gia.) Tj
T*
(j. ang ban khong ung nganh hang, su dung hinh anh minh hoa khong ung ve hang hoa, dich) Tj
T*
(vu uoc ang ban nham muc ich gian lan va/hoac thuc hien cac hanh vi vi pham phap luat.) Tj
T*
(k. Tang gia ban mot cach bat hop ly truoc khuyen mai.) Tj
T*
(l. Tao gia ban san pham qua cao hoac qua thap so voi mat bang gia tri thi truong.) Tj
T*
(C. HUONG DAN ANG BAN SAN PHAM TREN SHOPEE) Tj
T*
(Tieu e, hinh anh, gia ca, mo ta san pham va cac thong tin lien quan phai thong nhat, ung) Tj
T*
(chinh ta, ung quy inh ve ang tin cua Shopee. Cu the nhu sau:) Tj
T*
(1. Hinh anh san pham) Tj
T*
(a. Hinh anh san pham phai la anh chup ro, chi tiet tinh trang san pham. Khong uoc e) Tj
T*
(nhung hinh anh hoac thong tin khong lien quan en san pham nay nhu thong tin gioi thieu) Tj
T*
(shop, thong tin lien he hay thong tin thanh toan.) Tj
T*
(b. Phai co it nhat mot hinh anh that cua san pham do chinh Nguoi Ban tu chup. Trong anh) Tj
T*
(nay, dien tich san pham that phai chiem it nhat 40% dien tich toan anh.) Tj
T*
(c. Ngon ngu tren phong nen hinh anh la tieng Viet, khong dung ngon ngu nuoc ngoai.) Tj
T*
(d. Hinh anh khong chua yeu to ghe ron gay kho chiu cho nguoi xem.) Tj
T*
(e. Tuyet oi khong uoc ang cac hinh anh khoa than, khieu goi, phan cam, khong phu hop voi) Tj
T*
(thuan phong my tuc.) Tj
T*
(2. Ten san pham) Tj
T*
(a. Ten san pham phai mo ta ung hang hoa, dich vu uoc ang ban va phai la tieng Viet co) Tj
T*
(dau, u ky tu, ro nghia, khong dung cac ky tu ac biet, khong viet tat.) Tj
T*
(b. Ten goi cua san pham phai trung khop voi thong tin tren hinh anh san pham.) Tj
T*
(c. Ten san pham khong su dung loi le co noi dung dung tuc, bao luc; cac noi dung co tinh) Tj
T*
(chat ky thi dan toc, vung mien, xuc pham ton giao, gay inh kien ve gioi, nguoi khuyet) Tj
T*
(tat.) Tj
T*
(d. Neu su dung kem thuong hieu san pham \(Viet Nam hoac nuoc ngoai\) thi phan ten phai bao) Tj
T*
(gom tieng Viet i kem mo ta ngan gon san pham e nguoi mua co the hieu ro rang. Vi du:) Tj
T*
(Nuoc hoa Chanel Chance.) Tj
T*
