(d. NGUOI BAN chiu hoan toan trach nhiem voi Nguoi Mua/su dung thuoc neu vi pham cac quy) Tj
T*
(inh ve ang ban san pham thuoc khong ke on tren San Shopee.) Tj
T*
(4. Thong tin mo ta) Tj
T*
(a. Mo ta san pham can ay u va chi tiet, giup nguoi mua co the hieu ro nhung ac iem, cong) Tj
T*
(dung, cach dung, luu y khi su dung cua san pham, v.v... e lam can cu khi at mua hang.) Tj
T*
(Neu la san pham a qua su dung phai ghi ro tinh trang ben ngoai va hieu suat su dung cua) Tj
T*
(san pham. Tu ngu mo ta trung thuc, ro rang, khong lap lo hoac gay hieu lam cho khach) Tj
T*
(hang.) Tj
T*
(b. Neu la bai ang cho 1 san pham duy nhat thi ay la phan mo ta cho san pham o.) Tj
T*
(c. Neu la mot Combo gom nhieu san pham thi phai liet ke ay u thong tin cua tung san pham) Tj
T*
(co trong o.) Tj
T*
(d. Thong tin san pham khong bao gom so ien thoai va cac thong tin lien lac voi muc ich) Tj
T*
(quang cao hoac dan nguoi dung toi cac website khac.) Tj
T*
ET
