(e. ien ay u nguon goc, xuat xu, thuoc tinh san pham va che o bao hanh \(neu co\) theo yeu) Tj
T*
(cau cua moi nganh hang. San pham khong co giay to chung minh nguon goc xuat xu, thuong) Tj
T*
(hieu thi khong uoc e ten thuong hieu tren san pham.) Tj
T*
(f. Chu y gan ung hashtag lien quan voi san pham ang ban.) Tj
T*
(g. Khong chua tu khoa fake/nhai, cac ky tu ac biet hoac cac tu khoa tuong tu.) Tj
T*
(Luu y:) Tj
T*
(- Ngoai cac quy inh ve thong tin mo ta nhu neu tren, thong tin ve hang hoa uoc ang ban) Tj
T*
(phai bao gom cac noi dung bat buoc the hien tren nhan hang hoa theo quy inh phap luat ve) Tj
T*
(nhan hang hoa, tru cac thong tin co tinh chat rieng biet theo san pham nhu: nam, thang,) Tj
T*
(ngay san xuat; han su dung; so lo san xuat; so khung, so may;) Tj
T*
(- Nguoi Ban hang hoa, dich vu phai ap ung ieu kien au tu, kinh doanh thuoc danh muc) Tj
T*
(nganh, nghe au tu kinh doanh co ieu kien phai cong bo so, ngay cap va noi cap Giay phep,) Tj
T*
(Giay chung nhan u ieu kien, van ban xac nhan, hoac cac hinh thuc van ban khac theo quy) Tj
T*
(inh phap luat ve ieu kien kinh doanh cua nganh, nghe o.) Tj
T*
(5. Danh muc nganh hang) Tj
T*
(a. Nguoi ang phai chon ung nhom danh muc nganh hang cho san pham e co the de dang tiep) Tj
T*
(can voi khach hang.) Tj
T*
(b. Truong hop san pham nam ngoai nhung nganh hang san co, hay chon danh muc: San pham) Tj
T*
(khac.) Tj
T*
(c. Neu Nguoi Ban lua chon sai danh muc thi san pham se bi an hien thi cho en khi sua oi) Tj
T*
(va lua chon danh muc phu hop. Neu Nguoi Ban chi bam "cap nhat" ma khong thao tac chinh) Tj
T*
(sua gi, san pham se bi xoa.) Tj
T*
(d. Nguoi ban luu y, viec lua chon sai danh muc nganh hang co the bi coi la hanh vi gian) Tj
T*
(lan ma giam gia cua Shopee trong mot so truong hop va se bi Shopee xu ly theo chinh sach) Tj
T*
(xu ly hanh vi gian lan cua Shopee.) Tj
T*
(6. Gia san pham) Tj
T*
(a. Gia san pham ang ban hoac gia khuyen mai \(neu co\) phai tinh bang on vi VN.) Tj
T*
(b. Neu bai ang cho nhieu san pham, phai e gia ro rang cho tung san pham.) Tj
T*
(c. Gia san pham phai uoc phan loai ro rang dua tren kich co, mau sac, chat luong.) Tj
T*
(d. Nghiem cam nguoi ban tang gia goc cua san pham mot cach bat hop ly truoc khi tham gia) Tj
T*
(khuyen mai e phong ai ty le giam gia.) Tj
T*
(e. Gia san pham khong uoc thap hoac cao hon mot cach bat hop ly so voi mat bang gia cua) Tj
T*
(san pham cung loai tren San Shopee. Nguoi ban luu y viec e gia ban bat hop ly co the bi) Tj
T*
(coi la hanh vi gian lan trong mot so truong hop va se bi Shopee xu ly theo chinh sach xu) Tj
T*
(ly hanh vi gian lan cua Shopee.) Tj
T*
(7. Phi van chuyen) Tj
T*
(a. Nguoi Ban phai xac inh chinh xac khoi luong san pham can van chuyen e uoc luong chi) Tj
T*
(phi van chuyen.) Tj
T*
(b. Khoi luong san pham ang ky phai la khoi luong sau khi ong goi cua hang hoa e chuyen) Tj
T*
(i. Nguoi Ban chiu trach nhiem ve tinh chinh xac oi voi khoi luong san pham ang ky nay.) Tj
T*
(c. Voi cac san pham cong kenh, Nguoi Ban nen tham khao them Chinh sach van chuyen e biet) Tj
T*
(chi tiet cach thuc xac inh khoi luong san pham.) Tj
T*
(Tham khao Cach tinh phi van chuyen Shopee cho Nguoi ban tai ay .) Tj
T*
(8. Chat luong san pham) Tj
T*
(Nguoi Ban can am bao chat luong san pham phai ung nhu mo ta. San pham ang ban tren San) Tj
T*
(Shopee can co chat luong tot theo cac tieu chuan hien hanh, phan anh ung ky vong Nguoi) Tj
T*
(mua. Trong truong hop Nguoi ban bi nhieu Nguoi mua to cao, anh gia tieu cuc ve chat) Tj
T*
(luong san pham, Shopee co quyen ap dung cac bien phap phu hop len san pham/tai khoan cua) Tj
T*
